, "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Possessive Adjectives and Pronouns"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Possessive pronouns can take the place of nouns. You use possessive pronouns to talk about things that belong to someone. <br> You use possessive adjectives to describe nouns. They come before the noun."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Possessive  Adjectives\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Possessive Pronouns\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Examples\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">my</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> mine</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">This is <span class=\\\"strong\\\">my</span> bag. <br>You can borrow <span class=\\\"strong\\\">mine</span>.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">your</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> yours</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Is this <span class=\\\"strong\\\">your</span> bag?<br> That one is <span class=\\\"strong\\\">yours</span>.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">his</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> his</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">It's <span class=\\\"strong\\\">his</span> towel.<br>I have <span class=\\\"strong\\\">his</span>.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"She\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">her</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> hers</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Her</span> sunglasses are big.<br>Is this <span class=\\\"strong\\\">hers</span>?</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">our</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">ours</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Our</span> trip is next month.<br>So is <span class=\\\"strong\\\">ours</span>.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"They\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">their</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> theirs</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">These aren't <span class=\\\"strong\\\">their</span> swimsuits.<br>Are they <span class=\\\"strong\\\">theirs</span>?</span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "At the Beach"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you go to the beach, you wear a different type of clothing. This type of clothing is called <span class=\"italic\">swimwear</span> or  <span class=\"italic\">beachwear</span>. Remember that when you are referring to clothing or beach items, you use nouns.<br> Swimwear is the clothing you wear when in the water.<br>Beachwear is the clothing you wear at the beach, not in the water. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Men</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Women</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Swimwear</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">swimsuit <br>shorts/trunks</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">swimsuit *<br>bikini<br>tankini</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Beachwear</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">shorts<br>t-shirts<br>tank tops<br>flip flops<br>sunglasses</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">shorts<br>dresses<br>cover-ups<br>t-shirts<br>tank tops<br>flip flops<br>sunglasses</span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "* Another name for a swimsuit is a bathing suit. The name you use depends on where you live in the world."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "swimsuit"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a piece of clothing you wear for swimming "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I packed my swimsuit in my bag."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob10aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when packing for the beach."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bikini"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a piece of clothing in two separate parts that women wear for swimming"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like to wear a bikini in the summer."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob10aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "one-piece"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "clothing that consists of only one part; not separate parts "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am taking a one-piece swimsuit. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob10aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "towel "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a piece of cloth that you use for drying your skin "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Remember to take your beach towel. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob10aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cover-up"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a piece of clothing women put over their  swimsuit "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I don't have a cover-up for the beach. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob10aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "sunscreen"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a cream that you rub into your skin to stop the sun from burning you"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Remember to wear sunscreen at the beach."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob10aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "sunglasses "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "dark glasses that you wear to protect your eyes from the sun  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  Did you pack your sunglasses? It's very sunny in Mexico."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob10aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "beach bag"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a bag you put your things in when you go to the beach"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This looks like a nice beach bag."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob10aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to tan"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to make your skin darker by spending time in the sun."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like to tan at the beach."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob10aud09"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le05ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go on the internet or look in a magazine."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find images of swimwear and beachwear you like."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Cut them out or print them."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Label the images."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share your outfits with a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I identify different swimwear and beachwear."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about outfits."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share my outfit with a partner."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn3le05ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn3le05ob10re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn3le05ob10re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hey Vanessa! What are you doing? Still packing? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes, I am almost done. I have to pack for the beach though. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Can I help you?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Definitely! I don't know what I should or shouldn't bring.<br>", "id": 1, "time": "10", "image": "engenn3le05ob10re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: For the beach?! You need swimsuits and bikinis!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I packed a few one piece swimsuits and some bikinis. I packed my towels too.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Good. What about cover-ups?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh no! <br>", "id": 2, "time": "17000", "image": "engenn3le05ob10re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Don't worry, you can borrow mine. Sunscreen? Sunglasses?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Check. Which bag should I take to the beach? There's this one or this?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: This one. It looks like a beach bag. Do you have a blanket to lay on?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh right, I definitely want to tan in the sun. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Vanessa, I'd prefer you don't return looking like a lobster!<br>", "id": 3, "time": "34000", "image": "engenn3le05ob10re2img01.jpg"}]}}]}, {"id": 2, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn3le05ob10re5aud01", "coverimg": "engenn3le05ob10re5img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn3le05ob10re5img01.jpg"}]}}]}], "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids"